  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Palm Paradise is family-owned and operated! We have one rental property and this is it! Our family stays at this home on our own vacations and has been for decades; when you rent this home you deal directly with the owners, not a property manager or rental agency. You will have our cell phone numbers if any issues should arise during your stay. <br><br>This adorable home \"PALM PARADISE BEACHESCAPE\" is in a fabulous location south of Highway 30A, all in walking distance to beach access, restaurants, bars, shopping and more.<br><br>Enjoy the wonderful Gulf views from both the third floor covered porches and living areas. There are bedrooms on all floors (2 kings, 1 queen, 2 full/twin bunks), a great room on the second floor, and a sitting room on the third floor (1 queen sleeper sofa). There is also a third-floor sundeck for private sunbathing or watching the sunset. There is a separate laundry room, TV's in every bedroom, a fully-equipped kitchen, video games, DVD players, and beach/pool toys. There is off-street parking for 4-6 cars.<br><br>The beach access is just steps away (200 yards) with no busy roads to cross and has LIFEGUARDS, showers, restrooms, and a picnic area. When you are not at the beach, you can relax in the beautifully landscaped double-lot yard that contains a large private 28'X14' swimming pool and a palm tree-shaded area that is spacious enough for lawn games. Walk across the street to the fresh seafood market and grill your dinner on the natural gas grill provided for your use. <br><br>ADDITIONAL RENTAL INFORMATION:<br><br>* You must be 25 years old to rent<br>* Our rental rates are non-negotiable. Our best and most current rates are posted on the \"rate page\"<br>* Complimentary high-speed wireless internet access<br>* Complimentary domestic long distance<br>* No wait check-in and check-out<br><br>X NO PETS<br>X NO SMOKING<br>X NO STUDENT GROUPS<br>X NO WEDDING RECEPTIONS OR REHEARSALS",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "30A Beach Retreat: 4BR Home w/ Pool, Double Lot, Walk to Beach Access & Dining"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
